        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BAPBAP is a roguelike party game where you craft the most unfair builds to make your friends hate you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Invite and play with up to 7 friends in an all out brawl. Pick a random power after every round and craft</i> <i>the most ridiculous (or regrettable) build possible.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>BAPBAP is best played with friends who can handle betrayal. Set up custom games with wild rulesets, or jump into community-run servers and embrace the chaos. No matchmaking. No ranks. Just pure, dumb fun.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/7bf70e8573cd8298a9c847b9f77840bf.avif?t=1775195204\" width=800 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight, free-flowing combat that’ll have you screaming for your mom to get the camera. Everything is dodgeable so if you get clapped, that’s on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/da2562ccd122dcdbbd1580d828b57bac.poster.avif?t=1775195204\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/da2562ccd122dcdbbd1580d828b57bac.webm?t=1775195204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/da2562ccd122dcdbbd1580d828b57bac.mp4?t=1775195204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/ec608274f2992297571da68b1662d80a.avif?t=1775195204\" width=800 height=156 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or a goldfish piloting a mech. Or a Russian samurai. Or ramen with legs. Each characters comes with it’s own unique skillset and there’s a character design for everyone—even the freaks 👁️👄👁️.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/c4e16b26189030351884e535a7e43777.poster.avif?t=1775195204\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/c4e16b26189030351884e535a7e43777.webm?t=1775195204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/c4e16b26189030351884e535a7e43777.mp4?t=1775195204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/e01c4aeb564af48e88d31251ad95221f.avif?t=1775195204\" width=800 height=156 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it’s turning into a giant metallic duck, speccing into turretmancy, or literal poison, every game will present you with freshly randomized build combos to gamba with. Build synergies, get winnergies.   <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/2fb0bdc9800eb97df3ebdfdd4fd84672.poster.avif?t=1775195204\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/2fb0bdc9800eb97df3ebdfdd4fd84672.webm?t=1775195204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/2fb0bdc9800eb97df3ebdfdd4fd84672.mp4?t=1775195204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/29fad5af76808dfc67e867339e5fdd92.avif?t=1775195204\" width=800 height=157 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block escape routes with a crane’s payload, transform into a vending machine for a sneaky ambush, or do a drive-by in a 1942 Panzerkampfwagon Tiger Tank. BAPBAP is a PvP sandbox where nothing make sense but also everything makes sense.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/df2e4f10e587d738484ff71bf43e7b7b.poster.avif?t=1775195204\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/df2e4f10e587d738484ff71bf43e7b7b.webm?t=1775195204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/df2e4f10e587d738484ff71bf43e7b7b.mp4?t=1775195204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/5f81d1318c7c39389ed8138510e65157.avif?t=1775195204\" width=800 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On top of all that, you could get ganked by a roaming giga slime, fish up a nuclear bomb or come face to tentacle with [redacted]  - the better you are at adapting, the more you’ll win.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/98d55484844c609cdb54523f49f10dfa.poster.avif?t=1775195204\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/98d55484844c609cdb54523f49f10dfa.webm?t=1775195204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/98d55484844c609cdb54523f49f10dfa.mp4?t=1775195204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/67e45e011dddb8ce98e86cbfb4f22339.avif?t=1775195204\" width=800 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it’s the turnaround 1v3, hitting a sweet multi-target knock up or just watching your mates get hit by their own trap – BAPBAP is here to help you get that sweet hit of dopamine in this increasingly depressing world. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/32728e859eb5631aeae9ccf9fa757d01.poster.avif?t=1775195204\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/32728e859eb5631aeae9ccf9fa757d01.webm?t=1775195204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/32728e859eb5631aeae9ccf9fa757d01.mp4?t=1775195204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to BAPBAP, where logic goes to die. </strong></p>",
